{
 "about": "In the press: the scan that picks press items for nodo's files. scripts/press-feeds.mjs reads `feeds` every day on GitHub; the Mon/Thu cloud task adds web search on top and proposes items through scripts/press-merge.mjs. `pilot` lists the files scanned during the pilot; `aliases` adds search terms the files' data does not give. Every feed must be on nodo's source list (v1/sources.json): press-feeds.mjs skips any feed that is not, and the validator flags it.",
